    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***Email Enquiries Only***\n\nNew to the rental market is this well presented three bedroom bungalow, ideally situated in a mature estate.\n\nThe accommodation comprises of 3 double bedrooms - all with fitted wardrobes, sitting room with an electric fire, main bathroom and spacious kitchen/dining room.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from a tarmac driveway extending to the front and rear, together with a grass area to the front.\n\nGraiguenamanagh is a picturesque riverside town located on the banks of the River Barrow, offering a range of local amenities. The town is well known for its scenic riverside walks, Duiske Abbey and nearby Brandon Hill.\n\nThe property is approximately a 10-minute drive from Borris and approximately 20 minutes from Junction 7 of the M9 motorway at Paulstown, providing convenient access towards Kilkenny, Carlow, Waterford and Dublin."
      },
